{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-inventory-restock","title":"数字库存补货与售罄模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-digital-goods-delivery/digital-goods-catalog/digital-inventory-restock","wordCount":2025,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"数字库存补货与售罄模型\">数字库存补货与售罄模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>预生成池的补货是运营动作——上传一批码，池子变大；上游申领型商品的补货是<strong>运行时行为</strong>——每一次消耗都要去供应商换一条新码。后者的库存模型完全不同：池子里可能长期只有几十条在途凭证，真实的库存能力取决于上游的响应速度和配额，而不是本地表里的行数。</p>\n<p>这一篇处理三件事：什么时候触发补货（水位与需求预测）、向上游申领时如何避免过量占用（预占与配额）、以及申领失败如何回滚而不影响已经承诺给买家的订单。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[消耗速率监测] --&gt; B{可用量 &lt;= 低水位?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| A&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[发起补货请求]&#10;  C --&gt; D[上游供应商 API]&#10;  D --&gt; E{响应}&#10;  E --&gt;|成功| F[入库 + 指纹去重]&#10;  E --&gt;|限流/超时| G[退避重试]&#10;  E --&gt;|配额耗尽| H[标记供应商不可用]&#10;  F --&gt; I[可用量更新]&#10;  G --&gt; C&#10;  H --&gt; J[切换备用供应商&lt;br/&gt;或前台降级]&#10;  I --&gt; K[解除补货中标记]&#10;  J --&gt; K\">graph TD\n  A[消耗速率监测] --&gt; B{可用量 &lt;= 低水位?}\n  B --&gt;|否| A\n  B --&gt;|是| C[发起补货请求]\n  C --&gt; D[上游供应商 API]\n  D --&gt; E{响应}\n  E --&gt;|成功| F[入库 + 指纹去重]\n  E --&gt;|限流/超时| G[退避重试]\n  E --&gt;|配额耗尽| H[标记供应商不可用]\n  F --&gt; I[可用量更新]\n  G --&gt; C\n  H --&gt; J[切换备用供应商&lt;br/&gt;或前台降级]\n  I --&gt; K[解除补货中标记]\n  J --&gt; K</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>补货模式</th>\n<th>库存真实性</th>\n<th>前置时间</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>批量导入</td>\n<td>本地完全真实</td>\n<td>分钟到小时</td>\n<td>导入重复码、批次错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上游实时申领</td>\n<td>取决于上游配额</td>\n<td>亚秒到秒级</td>\n<td>上游抖动、超卖承诺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合（本地缓冲 + 上游回源）</td>\n<td>本地缓冲覆盖尖峰</td>\n<td>缓冲内为 0</td>\n<td>缓冲水位设定不当</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自签发</td>\n<td>本地完全真实</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>随机数质量、密钥安全</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"水位触发与需求预测\">水位触发与需求预测</h2><h3 id=\"低水位不是静态常数\">低水位不是静态常数</h3><p>上一章给出低水位的定性定义——补货前置时间内的预期消耗量。工程上它需要按 SKU 单独计算，因为不同 SKU 的消耗速率差几个数量级：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>95</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{reorder} = L \\cdot \\lambda_{p95} + z \\cdot \\sigma_{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">eor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是补货前置时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>95</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{p95}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是高峰时段的消耗速率（取 95 分位而非均值，因为均值会低估峰值），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是前置时间内的消耗标准差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 是服务水平系数（95% 服务水平对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.65</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z \\approx 1.65</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.65</span></span></span></span></span>）。这个式子就是库存管理里的再订货点（reorder point），它的价值在于把「低水位」从拍脑袋变成可复算的量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"需求预测用近期加权而非全量均值\">需求预测用近期加权而非全量均值</h3><p>数字商品的销量对事件极度敏感：一次版本更新、一次赛季开始会让点卡销量瞬间翻十倍。用 30 天均值定水位会在活动期间严重低估。实践中更稳的做法是指数加权移动平均，并对已知活动做<strong>人工叠加</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>λ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>λ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\lambda}_{t} = \\alpha \\lambda_{t} + (1-\\alpha)\\hat{\\lambda}_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1079em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2079em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = 0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span> 时，近期数据权重足够高但仍不过度抖动。已知活动（大版本发布、节日）由运营在活动日历里提前登记，触发时用活动的预期倍数覆盖预测值。活动日历是必须有的，因为纯统计模型无法从历史数据里预测一次从未发生过的联动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上游申领-预占-配额与去重\">上游申领：预占、配额与去重</h2><h3 id=\"预占式申领\">预占式申领</h3><p>向上游申领不能等到买家付款成功才发起——那会把供应商的响应时间直接加到用户的等待时间上。正确做法是在下单阶段就发起申领，把结果放进 <code>reserved</code> 状态（见 <a href=\"../digital-goods-catalog/digital-sku-card-pool\">数字 SKU 与卡密/凭证库存池</a>），支付超时则释放。这样用户的等待时间等于「本地预占+支付确认」，上游抖动被吸收在支付窗口内。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幂等向上游取码\">幂等向上游取码</h3><p>上游接口同样会超时。超时后重试同一个请求，必须保证不会换回两条不同的码，否则会产生「付了钱但上游扣了两次配额」的账目错误。做法是生成一个客户端请求号并在首次调用前落库：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE restock_request (&#10;  id            BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  pool_id       BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES voucher_pool(id),&#10;  supplier_id   BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  client_ref    UUID   NOT NULL,          -- 幂等键，调用前先落库&#10;  state         TEXT   NOT NULL,          -- pending|succeeded|failed|timeout&#10;  quantity      INT    NOT NULL,&#10;  attempt_count INT    NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  last_error    TEXT,&#10;  created_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  CONSTRAINT restock_ref_uniq UNIQUE (supplier_id, client_ref)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> restock_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pool_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> voucher_pool(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  supplier_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  client_ref    UUID   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 幂等键，调用前先落库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- pending|succeeded|failed|timeout</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quantity      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  attempt_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  last_error    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> restock_ref_uniq </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (supplier_id, client_ref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>重试时先按 <code>(supplier_id, client_ref)</code> 查已有请求：若 <code>state = &#39;succeeded&#39;</code> 直接复用返回的凭证；若仍是 <code>pending</code>，说明上一次调用的结果未知，此时<strong>不能</strong>再发一次新的申领，而应该去调用上游的查询接口对账（<code>GET /orders/{client_ref}</code>）——这就是支付领域通用的「超时不等于没发生」原则。只有当上游明确返回「无此请求」时才允许重发。</p>\n<h3 id=\"指纹去重是补货的必需步骤\">指纹去重是补货的必需步骤</h3><p>上游供应商在故障恢复后可能重发一批之前已经发过的码（同一批次补发）。如果平台不做去重，池子里会出现两条内容相同的凭证，它们会在某一天分别卖给两个买家——第二个买家兑换时提示「已被使用」，这是一类极难排查的客诉。入库时必须按 HMAC 指纹做批量去重：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"INSERT INTO voucher (pool_id, code_cipher, code_dek, code_fingerprint, status, batch_id)&#10;SELECT $1, c.cipher, c.dek, c.fp, &#39;available&#39;, $2&#10;  FROM unnest($3::bytea[], $4::bytea[], $5::bytea[]) AS c(cipher, dek, fp)&#10;ON CONFLICT (pool_id, code_fingerprint) DO NOTHING&#10;RETURNING id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> voucher (pool_id, code_cipher, code_dek, code_fingerprint, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, batch_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cipher</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dek</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'available'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unnest($</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bytea</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bytea</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bytea</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c(cipher, dek, fp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CONFLICT (pool_id, code_fingerprint) DO NOTHING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING id;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING</code> 配合 <code>(pool_id, code_fingerprint)</code> 唯一索引，让重复码被静默跳过而不是报错中断整批导入。这是 PostgreSQL 的冲突处理子句，官方文档给出其完整形式为 <code>ON CONFLICT [ conflict_target ] conflict_action [ RETURNING ... ]</code>，其中 <code>conflict_target</code> 可以是一个带可选谓词的索引列列表或一个约束名，<code>conflict_action</code> 取 <code>DO NOTHING</code> 或 <code>DO UPDATE SET</code>（见 <a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-insert.html\">PostgreSQL: INSERT</a>）。返回的行数就是实际入库数，与请求数之差即重复数——这个差值本身应该上报为一个指标，因为它代表上游的重复投递行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"售罄与降级\">售罄与降级</h2><h3 id=\"售罄必须在下单前判定\">售罄必须在下单前判定</h3><p>当本地可用量归零且上游不可用（或配额耗尽）时，SKU 必须立刻转为不可售。这里的竞态是：多个并发下单请求同时看到「可用量 1」，都决定继续。防住它的方式是让「判定可用」这一步也走凭证池的原子操作——即先尝试 <code>reserved</code> 一条凭证，成功了才算下单通过，失败了立刻返回售罄。任何「先查计数、再下单」的顺序都会在边界上超卖。</p>\n<h3 id=\"上游故障时的降级层级\">上游故障时的降级层级</h3><p>供应商不可用不等于必须立即下架。按影响面从小到大有三级降级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>用户可见性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 缓冲消耗</td>\n<td>上游响应变慢但仍成功</td>\n<td>继续销售，消耗本地缓冲</td>\n<td>无感知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 限流保护</td>\n<td>上游返回 429 或配额告警</td>\n<td>降低单笔限购数、暂停营销投放</td>\n<td>限购提示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 停售</td>\n<td>上游不可用或缓冲见底</td>\n<td>SKU 转 OutOfStock</td>\n<td>售罄/到货通知</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>L1 与 L2 的分界应当由上游的<strong>错误率</strong>而非单次错误决定：偶发一次超时不值得降级，连续一分钟错误率超阈值才进入 L2。这个判定与 <a href=\"../fraud-refund-revoke/instant-delivery-ops-monitor\">秒发成功率与异常监控</a> 里的燃烧率判据是同源的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批次与对账\">批次与对账</h2><h3 id=\"批次是供应商对账的最小单位\">批次是供应商对账的最小单位</h3><p>每一批入库的凭证都要有 <code>batch_id</code>，记录来源供应商、导入时间、请求号、实际入库数与被去重数。月末与供应商结算时，对账依据是「批次入库数 × 单价」，而不是「池子总消耗数」——后者混进了不同批次的码，无法归因。批次还承担有效期管理：不少卡密有激活截止日期，过期批次里的未售出凭证必须提前标记并从可售计数中扣除，否则会出现买家买到即过期的码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;batch_id&quot;: &quot;b-20260927-0031&quot;,&#10;  &quot;pool_id&quot;: 88213,&#10;  &quot;supplier_id&quot;: 41,&#10;  &quot;restock_request_id&quot;: 90112,&#10;  &quot;imported_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T09:40:11Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;requested&quot;: 5000,&#10;  &quot;inserted&quot;: 4987,&#10;  &quot;duplicated&quot;: 13,&#10;  &quot;invalid&quot;: 0,&#10;  &quot;expires_at&quot;: &quot;2027-09-27T00:00:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"batch_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"b-20260927-0031\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pool_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88213</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"supplier_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">41</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"restock_request_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90112</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"imported_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T09:40:11Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"requested\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"inserted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4987</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"duplicated\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">13</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"invalid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"expires_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027-09-27T00:00:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>duplicated</code> 与 <code>invalid</code> 分开统计很重要：前者是上游重发（不影响库存正确性），后者是上游发了格式不合法的码（需要向供应商索赔）。把两者合起来报成一个「导入失败数」会丢掉这个区分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>上游申领型商品的库存能力由供应商配额与响应速度决定，本地表只是缓冲；混合模式（本地缓冲 + 上游回源）是主流做法。</li>\n<li>低水位用再订货点公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>95</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = L \\cdot \\lambda_{p95} + z\\sigma_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 计算，消耗速率用指数加权移动平均预测，并对已知活动做人工叠加。</li>\n<li>向上游取码必须幂等：调用前先落库 <code>client_ref</code>，超时后先对账再决定重发，绝不盲目重试。</li>\n<li>指纹去重是补货的必需步骤；<code>ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING</code> 加唯一索引让重复码静默跳过，重复数上报为指标。</li>\n<li>上游故障按 L1 消耗缓冲 / L2 限流保护 / L3 停售三级降级；批次是供应商对账与有效期管理的最小单位。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数字库存补货与售罄模型","id":"数字库存补货与售罄模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"水位触发与需求预测","id":"水位触发与需求预测"},{"level":3,"text":"低水位不是静态常数","id":"低水位不是静态常数"},{"level":3,"text":"需求预测用近期加权而非全量均值","id":"需求预测用近期加权而非全量均值"},{"level":2,"text":"上游申领：预占、配额与去重","id":"上游申领-预占-配额与去重"},{"level":3,"text":"预占式申领","id":"预占式申领"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等向上游取码","id":"幂等向上游取码"},{"level":3,"text":"指纹去重是补货的必需步骤","id":"指纹去重是补货的必需步骤"},{"level":2,"text":"售罄与降级","id":"售罄与降级"},{"level":3,"text":"售罄必须在下单前判定","id":"售罄必须在下单前判定"},{"level":3,"text":"上游故障时的降级层级","id":"上游故障时的降级层级"},{"level":2,"text":"批次与对账","id":"批次与对账"},{"level":3,"text":"批次是供应商对账的最小单位","id":"批次是供应商对账的最小单位"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"销售区域与版权/许可限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-digital-goods-delivery/digital-goods-catalog/region-license-restriction"},"next":{"title":"支付成功即时发卡/激活","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-digital-goods-delivery/instant-fulfillment/post-pay-instant-issuance"}}